<h1>Both daemons accept <code>--env-file</code></h1>
<p>With {{ release.tag }}, the gateway and broker can each load a private <code>KEY=VALUE</code> file before serving, so a launchd job can run the gateway binary directly instead of through a wrapper script. The release also moves Wasmtime to 49.0.5 for three RustSec advisories. Neither change requires new configuration.</p>
